dy"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯微云文件管理</strong></div><p>管理微云文件的列表、上传、下载、删除、移动和分享。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>办公协同</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯微云文件管理" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:tencent-questionnaire-operator"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-survey" style="--capability-logo-bg:#effcf7;--capability-logo-color:#26b77a"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4h10v16H7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path><path d="m9 9 1.5 1.5L14 7M9 15h6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯问卷操作</strong></div><p>创建、修改和分析腾讯问卷，支持题目逻辑与回收统计。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>办公协同</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯问卷操作" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:tencent-rumor-checker"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-news" style="--capability-logo-bg:#fff2f3;--capability-logo-color:#e3404f">讯</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>鹅厂辟谣助手</strong></div><p>结合公开资料和内部参考，对腾讯相关传闻进行事实核查。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>信息资讯</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 鹅厂辟谣助手" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:tencent-map-assistant"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-map" style="--capability-logo-bg:#eef7ff;--capability-logo-color:#2f7cf6"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20s6-5.4 6-10a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 4.6 6 10 6 10Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯地图·地图助手</strong></div><p>调用地图地点搜索、路线规划和营业信息生成出行方案。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>生活服务</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯地图·地图助手" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:neodata-financial-search"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="neodata" style="--capability-logo-bg:#eef2ff;--capability-logo-color:#5c6ce7">N</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>NeoData 金融搜索服务</strong></div><p>自然语言查询股票、基金、宏观、外汇和大宗商品数据。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>投资理财</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 NeoData 金融搜索服务" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:document-to-markdown"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="markitdown" style="--capability-logo-bg:#fff7ed;--capability-logo-color:#c2410c">M</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>MarkItDown 文档转换</strong></div><p>把 PDF、Word、PPT、图片 OCR 和网页整理为结构化 Markdown。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-local">本地</span><span>内容创作</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 MarkItDown 文档转换" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:pingan-securities-news"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="pingan" style="--capability-logo-bg:#fff4ea;--capability-logo-color:#d87526">平安</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>平安证券资讯查询</strong></div><p>按股票、公司、行业、ETF 或概念检索新闻、快讯和研报。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>投资理财</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 平安证券资讯查询" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:tencent-stock-data"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-stock" style="--capability-logo-bg:#fff2ed;--capability-logo-color:#d64025"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 17V7M5 15l4-4 3 2 6-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path><path d="M15 6h3v3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯自选股·金融数据查询</strong></div><p>查询 A 股、港股、美股、指数和 ETF 的行情与基础数据。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>投资理财</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯自选股·金融数据查询" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:web-access"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="chrome" style="--capability-logo-bg:#eef5ff;--capability-logo-color:#4285f4"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle><path d="M12 3.5 17 12M4.7 8h9.8M8 19.5l4-7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>Web Access 浏览器自动化</strong></div><p>通过本地浏览器完成网页访问、登录态操作、表单填写和页面验证。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-local">本地</span><span>效率工具</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 Web Access 浏览器自动化" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:qq-music-assistant"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="qq-music" style="--capability-logo-bg:#effbea;--capability-logo-color:#61a915"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 18V6l8-2v11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle><circle cx="15.5" cy="15" r="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>QQ 音乐助手</strong></div><p>搜索歌曲、歌手、专辑和歌单，生成推荐与音乐信息摘要。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>生活服务</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 QQ 音乐助手" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:spreadsheet-analysis"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="excel" style="--capability-logo-bg:#e9f7ef;--capability-logo-color:#107c41">X</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>表格分析</strong></div><p>创建、清洗和分析 Excel/CSV，输出公式、图表和结论。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-loca