turedContent</code><span>object</span><span>可选</span><span>工具返回的结构化数据</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>isError</code><span>boolean</span><span>可选</span><span>工具是否返回执行错误</span></div></div><div class="catalog-tool-call"><label><span>调用参数（JSON）</span><textarea aria-label="调用 lookup_risk 的参数" spellCheck="false">{
