}</textarea></label><button class="button primary compact" type="button">调用工具</button></div></div></details><details><summary><span><strong>score_risk</strong><small>输出结构化风险等级</small></span><span>查看参数</span></summary><div><h4>输入参数</h4><div class="catalog-schema-table" role="table"><div class="catalog-schema-row catalog-schema-head" role="row"><span>字段</span><span>类型</span><span>要求</span><span>说明</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>company</code><span>string</span><span>可选</span><span>-</span></div></div><h4>调用响应</h4><div class="catalog-schema-table" role="table"><div class="catalog-schema-row catalog-schema-head" role="row"><span>字段</span><span>类型</span><span>要求</span><span>说明</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>tool_id</code><span>integer</span><span>必填</span><span>平台 Tool ID</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>tool_name</code><span>string</span><span>必填</span><span>MCP Tool 名称</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>result</code><span>object</span><span>必填</span><span>MCP ToolResult</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>session_id</code><span>string</span><span>必填</span><span>本次调用会话 ID</span></div></div><h4>Tool 结果</h4><div class="catalog-schema-table" role="table"><div class="catalog-schema-row catalog-schema-head" role="row"><span>字段</span><span>类型</span><span>要求</span><span>说明</span></div><div class="catalog-schema-row" role="row"><code>risk_level</code><span>string</span><span>必填</span><span>风险等级</span></div></div><div class="catalog-tool-call"><label><span>调用参数（JSON）</span><textarea aria-label="调用 score_risk 的参数" spellCheck="false">{
