ill:tencent-weiyun-manager"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-cloud" style="--capability-logo-bg:#eef4ff;--capability-logo-color:#3d6df2"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7.5 17.5h9.2a4 4 0 0 0 .1-8 5.3 5.3 0 0 0-10-1.2A4.6 4.6 0 0 0 7.5 17.5Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯微云文件管理</strong></div><p>管理微云文件的列表、上传、下载、删除、移动和分享。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>办公协同</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯微云文件管理" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:tencent-questionnaire-operator"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-survey" style="--capability-logo-bg:#effcf7;--capability-logo-color:#26b77a"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4h10v16H7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path><path d="m9 9 1.5 1.5L14 7M9 15h6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯问卷操作</strong></div><p>创建、修改和分析腾讯问卷，支持题目逻辑与回收统计。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</spa