" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle></svg></span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>腾讯地图·地图助手</strong></div><p>调用地图地点搜索、路线规划和营业信息生成出行方案。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>生活服务</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯地图·地图助手" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:neodata-financial-search"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="neodata" style="--capability-logo-bg:#eef2ff;--capability-logo-color:#5c6ce7">N</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>技能</span><strong>NeoData 金融搜索服务</strong></div><p>自然语言查询股票、基金、宏观、外汇和大宗商品数据。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>投资理财</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 NeoData 金融搜索服务" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card skill-card" data-card-filter="skill" data-od-id="crewon:preset:skill:document-to-markdown"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="markitdown" style="--cap