d-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card service-card" data-card-filter="service" data-od-id="crewon:preset:mcp:tencent-news"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="tencent-news" style="--capability-logo-bg:#fff2f3;--capability-logo-color:#e3404f">讯</span></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>服务</span><strong>腾讯新闻</strong></div><p>搜索热点、热榜、早晚报和实时新闻资讯。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span class="catalog-location-badge is-cloud">云端</span><span>信息资讯</span><span>预制</span></div></div><button aria-label="添加 腾讯新闻" class="icon-action compact catalog-card-action" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></article><article class="catalog-card service-card" data-card-filter="service" data-od-id="crewon:preset:mcp:qq-music"><div class="catalog-icon has-logo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="capability-brand-logo" data-logo="qq-music" style="--capability-logo-bg:#effbea;--capability-logo-color:#61a915"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 18V6l8-2v11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"></circle><circle cx="15.5" cy="15" r="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-lin